{"overview":"On the beach one night, Christine Faber, two years a widow, thinks she hears her late husband Paul calling out of the surf...then meets a tall dark man, Alexis, who seems to know all about such things. After more ghostly manifestations, Christine and younger sister Janet become enmeshed in the eerie artifices of Alexis; but he in turn finds himself manipulated into deeper deviltry than he had in mind...","tagline":"In his eyes, the threat of terror! In his hands, the power to destroy!","cast":[{"n":"Turhan Bey","c":"Alexis","p":"/YugYyfwqXp9C3Qj0oNaNJVmbf6.jpg","q":"Q78763"},{"n":"Lynn Bari","c":"Christine Faber","p":"/dY4ZYtiCGBXyVtjrE3TjwRD4EJh.jpg","q":"Q274262"},{"n":"Cathy O'Donnell","c":"Janet Burke","p":"/4FfBkBohhL26g8SSXHrHts6n57H.jpg","q":"Q524094"},{"n":"Richard Carlson","c":"Martin Abbott","p":"/dTKsl3WAzvfFBHAgOmwt959oFHi.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Donald Curtis","c":"Paul Faber","p":"/2VrI2eZXGhESrx9E5EuAbGtqkFF.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Virginia Gregg","c":"Emily","p":"/AmNAKjlShaPxv7C3Z2xYC0vvSk5.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Norma Varden","c":"Wealthy looking woman","p":"/6f52jKhHnQRscajyhIoGNMNo4N7.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Harry Mendoza","c":"Hoffman","p":null,"q":null}],"country":["United States"],"language":["English"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Amazing_Mr._X","qid":"Q2177681","rel":{"CA":{"d":"1948-07-29","c":"14A"},"US":{"d":"1948-07-29"}},"backdrops":["/qfqPjFsuw9rMIp9jyAd1QHl04KJ.jpg","/4fodyfHd5YeTgMbUqfKy6rlzEgQ.jpg","/ieBGRtuBHeZ3IhOQpMsNoRMhV4k.jpg","/rGG62mij0HZ7N6mRIaluEe3TyM7.jpg","/7wQltbZDQis27mRtPBwAm7c5xES.jpg","/2pGt5qOnAiMztynVW37UiHi0Csz.jpg","/gD5cpYi57g9AYavdDjdDYGZoAr6.jpg","/siaikboAsVZSNiBn4fKOvtEr4tC.jpg"]}